Charge Credit-Card
  post
  https://api.icount.co.il/api/v3.php/cc/bill

  Request
    Body
    
    application/json
    cc_cvv
    sid
    string
    Session ID
    
    cid
    string
    Company identifier
    
    user
    string
    Username
    
    pass
    string
    Password
    
    client_id
    integer
    Client ID
    
    custom_client_id
    string
    Custom Client ID (from external system)
    
    vat_id
    number<float>
    Client VAT ID
    
    email
    string
    Client email
    
    client_name
    string
    Client name
    
    sum
    number<float>
    required
    Amount to charge
    
    use_j5_if_available
    boolean
    Use preapproved transaction (J5) if available
    
    num_of_payments
    integer
    Number of installments.
    
    first_payment
    number<float>
    First payment amount. Applicable only if num_of_payments>1. If not passed - defaults to all installments being equal amount
    
    is_credit
    boolean
    Is Credit? Applicable only if num_of_payments>1.
    
    currency_id
    integer
    Currency ID
    
    currency_code
    string
    Currency Code (3-letter code defined by ISO-4217)
    
    currency
    string
    Currency identified (either ID, or Code, or name)
    
    cc_token_id
    integer
    Stored card token ID. -storage
    
    cc_number
    number
    Credit-Card number
    
    cc_type
    string
    Credit-Card type
    
    cc_cvv
    number
    CVV - Card Verification number (3 or 4 digits on the back of the card)
    
    cc_validity
    number
    Card validity month in either YYYY-MM or MMYY format
    
    cc_holder_id
    number
    Card holder ID number
    
    cc_holder_name
    string
    Card holder name
    
    payment_description
    string
    Payment description
    
    is_test
    boolean
    Is test transaction? If true, the system will not call credit-card providers and success/failure will depend only on card number validity.

  Responses
    200
    OK

